  "_reply_doc": "First-person offers and questions about re-running work that already shipped. Both are blocked, because asking the same question again costs the user a round trip to answer it. The object has to be an asset or a pronoun standing for one, so a deterministic rebuild (types, a lockfile, a typecheck, a test run) never matches. Reporting that old assets are in an older style, and that they are retired in place, is information and is never blocked.",
